# analysis/ holds our reports and small artifacts. This file decides what goes to GitHub.
#
# SHARED:      reports, pre-registrations, plots, small result tables, analysis scripts.
# NOT SHARED:  (1) anything that reconstructs the provided tracking -- the parsed caches --
#                  because RULES.md forbids publishing tracking exports;
#              (2) per-frame labels, predictions and converted files derived from Metrica's
#                  sample games -- the commands in each REPORT.md regenerate them;
#              (3) logs and pickles.
# Later lines win over earlier ones, so the ignores below override the allow-list.

*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*.md
!*.png
!*.py
!*.json
!*.txt
!*.csv

cache/
raw/
tmp/
predictions/
labels/
labels_*.csv
eval_out/reports/
**/validate/*.csv
events_definitions.txt
__pycache__/
*.npz
*.pkl
*.log
